BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:a4916df642eb892494a0a76e989678f0@mdh
DTSTAMP:20260730T124805Z
DTSTART:20260730T230000Z
DTEND:20260730T235000Z
SUMMARY:🏒 Stick & Puck – Sylvania\, OH
DESCRIPTION:<p>This clinic is designed for ages 12 and up. There is a Travel or Highschool level requirement for this clinic. This clinic is similar to Overspeed 2 in some of the content. However\, advanced game concepts using small area games will be more of an emphasis than in Overspeed 2.&nbsp\; Also\, game concepts like breakouts\, angling\, boardplay in defensive zone\, creating and taking away time and space will all be covered.&nbsp\; This clinic will also have a more technical approach to stickhandling and shooting concepts than other clinics. Learning how to protect and transfer the puck in traffic and learning various shooting techniques will be reinforced. There is also a dryland session that precedes each ice time.Mondays:</p>\n<p>Dryland 6:30pm/Ice 7:30-8:50pm<br />Thursdays: Dryland 6pm/Ice 7-7:50pm&nbsp\;</p>\n<p>*NO REFUNDS/CREDITS</p>\nRink: Tam-O-Shanter Ice Rink – Sylvania\, OH\n~58 mi from Ann Arbor\nPrice: $10\nSource: DaySmart\nInfo: https://apps.daysmartrecreation.com/dash/x/#/online/tamoshanter/event-registration\nConfirm with rink — schedule subject to change.
LOCATION:Tam-O-Shanter Ice Rink – Sylvania\, OH
URL:https://apps.daysmartrecreation.com/dash/x/#/online/tamoshanter/event-registration
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:78e7d1feba0470f2918a8f2457ed8487@mdh
DTSTAMP:20260730T124805Z
DTSTART:20260731T230000Z
DTEND:20260731T235000Z
SUMMARY:🏒 Stick & Puck – Sylvania\, OH
DESCRIPTION:<p>Dialed In Goaltending is focused on extending goaltenders opportunity to further life and hockey.</p>\n<p>Instructors with over a decade of instructing and coaching experience\, Dialed In Goaltending is taking charge of this forgotten position and teaching the valuable craft needed to succeed on and off the ice. The approach is aimed at developing technical and physical aspects needed to be a top-tier goaltender today. Continued learning of top puck-stoppers in today&rsquo\;s game accelerates our teaching. Properly conveying and implementing techniques develops the confidence of a Dialed In Goaltender.</p>\nThe clinics offered will supplement the engagement and reinforce the repetitions needed in developing technique and the effective base to continue succeeding.<br /><br />*NO REFUNDS/CREDITS\nRink: Tam-O-Shanter Ice Rink – Sylvania\, OH\n~58 mi from Ann Arbor\nPrice: $10\nSource: DaySmart\nInfo: https://apps.daysmartrecreation.com/dash/x/#/online/tamoshanter/event-registration\nConfirm with rink — schedule subject to change.
LOCATION:Tam-O-Shanter Ice Rink – Sylvania\, OH
URL:https://apps.daysmartrecreation.com/dash/x/#/online/tamoshanter/event-registration
END:VEVENT
